[h1]Trade provinces for gold, swap borderlands, or yield a colony to seize a fortress—ALL IN ONE PEACE TREATY![/h1]

[quote]
[b]"Why can't I offer 500 ducats and a border province in exchange for that key mountain fortress?"[/b]
Since 2013, Europa Universalis IV has locked every peace negotiation into a rigid one-way street: you can either [b]Demand[/b] terms OR [b]Offer[/b] concessions—never both. Switching tabs wipes your draft clean.

[b]Foch Bilateral Peace[/b] breaks that decade-old limit. Draft real, historical two-way peace treaties where both sides give and take in a single negotiated settlement!
[/quote]

